sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Student
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant AUTH as Auth Service
    participant USER as User Service
    participant JOB as Job Service
    participant AI as AI Service
    participant NOTIF as Notification Service
    participant F as Faculty
    participant E as Employer
    participant CERT as Certificate Service
    participant BC as Blockchain Service
    participant DB as Database
    participant CACHE as Redis Cache

    Note over S,CACHE: Student Registration & Profile Setup
    S->>FE: Register account
    FE->>API: POST /auth/register
    API->>AUTH: validateRegistration(userData)
    AUTH->>USER: createUser(userData)
    USER->>DB: INSERT user, student records
    DB-->>USER: user created
    USER-->>AUTH: user object
    AUTH->>AUTH: generateTokens()
    AUTH-->>API: tokens + user data
    API-->>FE: authentication response
    FE-->>S: registration success

    Note over S,CACHE: Profile Update & Resume Upload
    S->>FE: Update profile + upload resume
    FE->>API: PUT /students/profile (with file)
    API->>AUTH: validateToken()
    AUTH-->>API: user validated
    API->>USER: updateStudentProfile(data)
    USER->>AI: parseResume(resumeFile)
    AI->>AI: extractSkills(resumeText)
    AI-->>USER: parsed skills data
    USER->>DB: UPDATE student profile
    DB-->>USER: profile updated
    USER-->>API: success response
    API-->>FE: profile updated
    FE-->>S: profile update success

    Note over S,CACHE: AI Recommendation Generation
    FE->>API: GET /recommendations
    API->>AUTH: validateToken()
    AUTH-->>API: user validated
    API->>AI: generateRecommendations(studentId)
    AI->>DB: getStudentProfile(studentId)
    DB-->>AI: student data
    AI->>DB: getActiveJobPostings()
    DB-->>AI: job postings
    AI->>AI: calculateSimilarity(studentProfile, jobPostings)
    AI->>AI: rankRecommendations()
    AI->>CACHE: cacheRecommendations(studentId, recommendations)
    AI-->>API: top recommendations
    API-->>FE: recommendations list
    FE-->>S: personalized job recommendations

    Note over S,CACHE: Job Application Flow
    S->>FE: Apply to job
    FE->>API: POST /applications
    API->>AUTH: validateToken()
    AUTH-->>API: user validated
    API->>JOB: createApplication(studentId, jobId)
    JOB->>DB: getStudentMentor(studentId)
    DB-->>JOB: mentor info
    JOB->>DB: INSERT application
    DB-->>JOB: application created
    JOB->>NOTIF: sendMentorApprovalRequest(mentorId, applicationId)
    NOTIF->>DB: INSERT notification
    NOTIF->>NOTIF: sendEmail(mentorEmail, approvalRequest)
    JOB-->>API: application submitted
    API-->>FE: application success
    FE-->>S: application submitted

    Note over F,CACHE: Mentor Approval Process
    F->>FE: Login to mentor dashboard
    FE->>API: GET /applications/pending-approval
    API->>AUTH: validateToken()
    AUTH-->>API: mentor validated
    API->>JOB: getPendingApprovals(mentorId)
    JOB->>DB: SELECT pending applications
    DB-->>JOB: pending applications
    JOB-->>API: applications list
    API-->>FE: pending approvals
    FE-->>F: approval requests

    F->>FE: Approve application
    FE->>API: PUT /applications/{id}/approve
    API->>AUTH: validateToken()
    AUTH-->>API: mentor validated
    API->>JOB: approveApplication(applicationId, mentorId, comments)
    JOB->>DB: UPDATE application status
    DB-->>JOB: application approved
    JOB->>NOTIF: notifyStudent(studentId, approvalStatus)
    JOB->>NOTIF: notifyEmployer(employerId, newApplication)
    NOTIF->>DB: INSERT notifications
    JOB-->>API: approval success
    API-->>FE: application approved
    FE-->>F: approval confirmed

    Note over E,CACHE: Employer Review & Selection
    E->>FE: Login to employer dashboard
    FE->>API: GET /applications/for-review
    API->>AUTH: validateToken()
    AUTH-->>API: employer validated
    API->>JOB: getApplicationsForReview(employerId)
    JOB->>DB: SELECT applications for employer jobs
    DB-->>JOB: applications list
    JOB-->>API: applications data
    API-->>FE: applications for review
    FE-->>E: candidate applications

    E->>FE: Shortlist candidate
    FE->>API: PUT /applications/{id}/shortlist
    API->>AUTH: validateToken()
    AUTH-->>API: employer validated
    API->>JOB: shortlistCandidate(applicationId)
    JOB->>DB: UPDATE application status
    DB-->>JOB: candidate shortlisted
    JOB->>NOTIF: notifyStudent(studentId, shortlistStatus)
    JOB->>NOTIF: notifyMentor(mentorId, shortlistStatus)
    NOTIF->>DB: INSERT notifications
    JOB-->>API: shortlist success
    API-->>FE: candidate shortlisted
    FE-->>E: shortlist confirmed

    Note over E,CACHE: Interview Scheduling
    E->>FE: Schedule interview
    FE->>API: POST /interviews
    API->>AUTH: validateToken()
    AUTH-->>API: employer validated
    API->>JOB: scheduleInterview(applicationId, dateTime, location)
    JOB->>DB: INSERT interview record
    DB-->>JOB: interview scheduled
    JOB->>NOTIF: createCalendarEvent(interviewDetails)
    NOTIF->>NOTIF: syncToGoogleCalendar()
    NOTIF->>NOTIF: syncToOutlookCalendar()
    JOB->>NOTIF: notifyAllParties(interviewDetails)
    NOTIF->>DB: INSERT notifications
    JOB-->>API: interview scheduled
    API-->>FE: scheduling success
    FE-->>E: interview confirmed

    Note over E,CACHE: Internship Completion & Feedback
    E->>FE: Provide completion feedback
    FE->>API: POST /applications/{id}/feedback
    API->>AUTH: validateToken()
    AUTH-->>API: employer validated
    API->>JOB: submitFeedback(applicationId, feedbackData)
    JOB->>DB: INSERT feedback record
    JOB->>DB: UPDATE application status to completed
    DB-->>JOB: feedback recorded
    JOB->>CERT: triggerCertificateGeneration(applicationId)
    CERT->>DB: getCertificateData(applicationId)
    DB-->>CERT: student and internship data
    CERT->>CERT: generateCertificatePDF()
    CERT->>CERT: createOpenBadgeJSON()
    CERT->>BC: anchorToBlockchain(certificateHash)
    BC->>BC: submitToBlockchain()
    BC-->>CERT: blockchain transaction ID
    CERT->>DB: INSERT certificate record
    DB-->>CERT: certificate created
    CERT->>NOTIF: notifyStudent(certificateReady)
    NOTIF->>DB: INSERT notification
    CERT-->>JOB: certificate generated
    JOB-->>API: feedback submitted
    API-->>FE: feedback success
    FE-->>E: completion confirmed

    Note over S,CACHE: Certificate Verification
    S->>FE: View certificate
    FE->>API: GET /certificates/{id}
    API->>AUTH: validateToken()
    AUTH-->>API: student validated
    API->>CERT: getCertificate(certificateId)
    CERT->>DB: SELECT certificate
    DB-->>CERT: certificate data
    CERT-->>API: certificate details
    API-->>FE: certificate data
    FE-->>S: certificate displayed

    Note over S,CACHE: Public Certificate Verification
    participant V as Verifier
    V->>FE: Verify certificate (public)
    FE->>API: GET /verify/{certificateHash}
    API->>CERT: verifyCertificate(certificateHash)
    CERT->>BC: verifyBlockchainAnchor(hash)
    BC->>BC: checkBlockchainRecord()
    BC-->>CERT: verification result
    CERT->>DB: getCertificateMetadata(hash)
    DB-->>CERT: certificate metadata
    CERT-->>API: verification response
    API-->>FE: verification result
    FE-->>V: certificate authenticity

    Note over S,CACHE: Analytics & Reporting
    participant PO as Placement Officer
    PO->>FE: View analytics dashboard
    FE->>API: GET /analytics/dashboard
    API->>AUTH: validateToken()
    AUTH-->>API: placement officer validated
    API->>CACHE: getAnalyticsCache(dashboardKey)
    CACHE-->>API: cached data (if exists)
    
    alt Cache Miss
        API->>JOB: generateAnalytics(filters)
        JOB->>DB: aggregateApplicationData()
        JOB->>DB: aggregatePlacementData()
        DB-->>JOB: analytics data
        JOB->>CACHE: cacheAnalytics(data, ttl: 300)
        JOB-->>API: analytics response
    end
    
    API-->>FE: dashboard data
    FE-->>PO: analytics dashboard

    Note over S,CACHE: Real-time Notifications
    loop Real-time Updates
        NOTIF->>FE: WebSocket push notification
        FE->>FE: updateUI(notification)
        FE->>S: show notification
    end

    Note over S,CACHE: Background Jobs
    loop Async Processing
        AI->>CACHE: processRecommendationQueue()
        CERT->>CACHE: processBlockchainQueue()
        NOTIF->>CACHE: processEmailQueue()
    end